@host = http://localhost:5002

### Liste des clients
GET {{host}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

### Créer un client
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Saad",
  "email": "saad@example.com"
}

### Client par id
GET {{host}}/api/customers/1

### Santé (readiness)
GET {{host}}/health/ready
